<?xml version="1.0"?>
<!--
  myCobot 280 M5 arm, copied from elephantrobotics/mycobot_ros2 (d42ff61):
  mycobot_description/urdf/mycobot_280_m5/mycobot_280_m5.urdf

  Changes from upstream:
  - The g_base link has no visual or collision. Upstream draws the optional G-base
    mounting plate there, which this robot does not have; the arm bolts straight
    onto the myAGV. Meshes still load from mycobot_description.
  - Inertials added (upstream has none; MuJoCo rejects massless moving bodies).
    Masses are estimates summing to the ~0.85 kg spec; the inertia tensors are
    solid boxes over each mesh's bounding box. Not measured.
  - Revolute velocity limits set to 2.79 rad/s (160 deg/s spec) instead of 0.

